# ABP Interceptors

## Creating an Interceptor
```csharp
public class MyInterceptor : AbpInterceptor, ITransientDependency
{
    public override async Task InterceptAsync(IAbpMethodInvocation invocation)
    {
        // Before method execution
        Logger.LogInformation($"Calling: {invocation.Method.Name}");
        
        await invocation.ProceedAsync();
        
        // After method execution
        Logger.LogInformation($"Called: {invocation.Method.Name}");
    }
}
```

## Registering Interceptor
```csharp
public override void PreConfigureServices(ServiceConfigurationContext context)
{
    context.Services.OnRegistered(ctx =>
    {
        if (ShouldIntercept(ctx.ImplementationType))
        {
            ctx.Interceptors.TryAdd<MyInterceptor>();
        }
    });
}
```

Note: Methods must be `virtual` for interception to work.
